# Ignore all font directories except those committed to the repo.
# The full-charset Noto Sans/Serif CJK families are downloaded on demand by
# build-sd-fonts.py for SD-card reading fonts; NotoSansCJKtcUiSubset is a
# separate, pre-subsetted cut (see gen_cjk_ui_intervals.py) with only the
# glyphs the built-in UI fonts need — not the same asset, don't conflate them.
*
!.gitignore
!NotoSerif/
!NotoSerif/**
!NotoSans/
!NotoSans/**
!NotoSansArabic/
!NotoSansArabic/**
!NotoSansHebrew/
!NotoSansHebrew/**
!NotoSansCJKtcUiSubset/
!NotoSansCJKtcUiSubset/**
!OpenDyslexic/
!OpenDyslexic/**
!Ubuntu/
!Ubuntu/**
